S. DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE ACTION', 'text': 'DUBLIN, JUNE 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AON PLC (NYSE: AON) AND WILLIS TOWERS WATSON (NASDAQ: WLTW) SHARED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT TODAY IN RESPONSE TO THE LEGAL ACTION TAKEN BY THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE: "WE DISAGREE WITH THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE\'S ACTION, WHICH REFLECTS A LACK OF UNDERSTANDING OF OUR BUSINESS, THE CLIENTS WE SERVE AND THE MARKETPLACES IN WHICH WE OPERATE. AON AND WILLIS TOWERS WATSON OPERATE ACROSS BROAD,\xa0COMPETITIVE AREAS OF THE ECONOMY AND OUR PROPOSED COMBINATION WILL ACCELERATE INNOVATION ON BEHALF OF CLIENTS CREATING MORE CHOICE IN AN ALREADY DYNAMIC AND COMPETITIVE MARKETPLACE.'}